    <dashboard name='Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/DemandDashboard-Pandora_17304540594900/MetricDefinitions?rev=' id='MetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/DemandDashboard-Pandora_17304540594900' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-title'>
          <format attr='font-family' value='Tableau Medium' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='dash-subtitle'>
          <format attr='font-family' value='Tableau Medium' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='font-family' value='Tableau Regular' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <zone fixed-size='51' forceUpdate='true' h='7375' id='6' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='20'>Demand Report - Pandora</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='13750' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='8375'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>General Definitions:</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>
- Timeframe: Current timeframe (yesterday, current month (excl. today), etc.)
- Percentage comparison:
 -&gt; Daily: Yesterday vs. same weekday last week
 -&gt; Weekly: Current week (excl. today) vs same period last week
 -&gt; Monthly, Quarterly: Same logic as weekly</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='343' forceUpdate='true' h='43875' id='5' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='22125'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>Metrics:</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>
- Orders: All vaild orders within the timeframe
- Acquisitions: Customers who placed their first valid order within the timeframe (based on ACID)
- AFV (Average Food Value): AFV = Food Value / Orders
- Delivery Fee: Delivery Fees collected (including tax)
- Revenue (net) 
   - For all verticals EXCEPT Dmart: Commision Revenue + Non Commission Revenue + Surcharges + Service Fee + Delivery Fee - Revenue Reductions (all net of taxes) 
  - For Dmart: Front Margins + Supplier Support Front Margins + Back Margins + Delivery Fee + Surcharges + Service Fee + NMR - Revenue Reductions (all net of taxes) 


</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>Æ  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>NOTE: </run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>Æ  </run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>1. NMR is not yet available for Dmart</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>  2. Non Commission Revenues: Only include Ads NCR (CPC, CPP), and does not include other NCR such as card fee, etc</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>  3. Dmart&apos;s Revenue includes both front &amp; back margins, but back margins are at the moment only available for MY, HK, TH &amp; SG</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>&#10;- DH Incentive Cost Mktg: </run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Voucher and Discount</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'> costs, excluding revenue reductions and incentives not related to Marketing activities (Note that Online and Offline costs are NOT included), and including FDNC cost.
- DH ICpO: Costs for vouchers and discounts not paid by vendors / Orders
- DH ICpGMV: Costs for vouchers and discounts not paid by vendors / GMV
- Vendor Incentive Spent: Voucher and discount costs paid by vendors</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='1040' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98000' id='1039' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                <zone fixed-size='51' forceUpdate='true' h='7375' id='6' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='20'>Demand Report - Pandora</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='13750' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='8375'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>General Definitions:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>
- Timeframe: Current timeframe (yesterday, current month (excl. today), etc.)
- Percentage comparison:
 -&gt; Daily: Yesterday vs. same weekday last week
 -&gt; Weekly: Current week (excl. today) vs same period last week
 -&gt; Monthly, Quarterly: Same logic as weekly</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='343' forceUpdate='true' h='43875' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='22125'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>Metrics:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>
- Orders: All vaild orders within the timeframe
- Acquisitions: Customers who placed their first valid order within the timeframe (based on ACID)
- AFV (Average Food Value): AFV = Food Value / Orders
- Delivery Fee: Delivery Fees collected (including tax)
- Revenue (net) 
   - For all verticals EXCEPT Dmart: Commision Revenue + Non Commission Revenue + Surcharges + Service Fee + Delivery Fee - Revenue Reductions (all net of taxes) 
  - For Dmart: Front Margins + Supplier Support Front Margins + Back Margins + Delivery Fee + Surcharges + Service Fee + NMR - Revenue Reductions (all net of taxes) 


</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>Æ  </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>NOTE: </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>Æ  </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>1. NMR is not yet available for Dmart</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>  2. Non Commission Revenues: Only include Ads NCR (CPC, CPP), and does not include other NCR such as card fee, etc</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#b8209d'>  3. Dmart&apos;s Revenue includes both front &amp; back margins, but back margins are at the moment only available for MY, HK, TH &amp; SG</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>&#10;- DH Incentive Cost Mktg: </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Voucher and Discount</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'> costs, excluding revenue reductions and incentives not related to Marketing activities (Note that Online and Offline costs are NOT included), and including FDNC cost.
- DH ICpO: Costs for vouchers and discounts not paid by vendors / Orders
- DH ICpGMV: Costs for vouchers and discounts not paid by vendors / GMV
- Vendor Incentive Spent: Voucher and discount costs paid by vendors</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{3BE409F7-30A5-4EA9-B87A-886E15F04011}' />
    </dashboard>
